Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:05.47,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:07.85,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.19,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:14.63,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:25.34,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,We were able to escape from the set course
