Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:28.89,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,along the boundary between sky and sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:34.15,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now we're rowing our way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:40.67,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,to a hidden adventure at the dark bottom of the sea.
