Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.99,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.05,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:20.54,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:26.77,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:33.72,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.09,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:40.40,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:44.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:47.44,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:04.65,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.99,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:11.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.65,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:17.83,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:20.17,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:38.17,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,1600)}幽靈島的冒險與\N名醫霍古巴克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幽靈島到底是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.79,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:45.03,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂，剛才那個幽靈跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:46.79,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,還在船上嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:49.80,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不，它飄向那座島了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:51.35,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,大概住在那裡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:53.98,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,剛才搖得很厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:56.89,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,也許是那個像嘴巴的門關上的聲音？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:03:01.03,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我想我們被那張嘴「吞下去」了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:02.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,吞下去？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:04.45,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,霧這麼濃很難看清楚，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:08.75,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,但看起來有一道柵欄從門延伸到整座島的周圍。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:15.34,Main,Robin,0,554,0,,也就是說我們被困在那道柵欄裡面了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:15.34,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(672,100)\fad(800,0)}幽靈島\N「Thriller Bark」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:15.34,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(1076,100)\fad(800,0)}目前位置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:15.34,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(1118,100)\fad(800,0)}「嘴巴」門
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.77,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:20.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,所以那個骷髏才叫我們趕快離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:25.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那就表示有人把這裡做成了一座漂流島！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.15,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,但為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:30.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不管原因是什麼，重要的是我們現在在海中央。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們不能在這裡下錨。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂喂，你們為什麼在討論停留的事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們現在就得走，趁被詛咒之前！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:37.60,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,聽好了，各位…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:40.85,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我覺得我得了「不能上那座島」病。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:41.61,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:42.68,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我也得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.30,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那你們留在這裡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:48.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你得的是「冒險準備完畢」病嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,再考慮一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:51.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫，你仔細看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:53.71,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那邊那棟詭異的建築…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那是真正的鬼屋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你太小看…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.75,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,惡靈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:02.97,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:05.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我會盡可能小心的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要抓住剛才那個幽靈來當寵物！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,完全小看了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:13.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,但不管怎樣，我們得去找回\N我們珍貴的夥伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士，海賊便當！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,夥伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我反對！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:21.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果讓那個骷髏跟我們走，我晚上會嚇得睡不著！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.86,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,便當準備好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:25.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫，佛朗基。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們兩個好好照顧羅賓小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:31.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,去探索未知的島嶼讓我渾身發冷。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.61,0:04:32.70,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你開玩笑的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:33.82,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,羅賓也去嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.45,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我喜歡刺激。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.70,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:42.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好了你們，我們得搭船到島上去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:46.10,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,但你們還沒看過我的禮物呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:49.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,船塢系統二號頻道。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:50.92,Main,all,0,0,0,,二號？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:54.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這個系統有五個頻道。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:56.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有兩個零號，然後，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,一號，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,二號，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:00.70,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,三號，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:01.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,四號。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:05.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,每一個都有各自專門的用途。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.43,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:09.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,零號的槳和一號、三號的船塢我們已經看過了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但你說二號和四號是空的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:16.78,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那是因為是禮物，所以我故意不說的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:20.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不去島上的人可以先試用看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,船塢系統二號頻道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:29.97,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:32.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,會出來什麼東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,蒸汽動力…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:36.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,槳船！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,購物船，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,迷你梅利二號！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:39.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是梅利！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:42.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,梅利回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:45.29,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,雖然小了點，但我們又能坐梅利了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.00,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,沒想到他準備了這麼棒的禮物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,謝謝你，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:55.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果那是我們的購物船，隨時都想去購物！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:57.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,輪到我了！快點，輪到我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:01.24,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,真的很棒。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:04.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,等等，草帽，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:07.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們待會兒就坐。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.10,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,先讓他們玩吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:12.29,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,全部都是這些了嗎，佛朗基？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:13.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:17.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,加上你們之前看過的一號和三號，全部就是這些了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.97,0:06:20.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,零號頻道——輔助槳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:24.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,一號頻道，可搭載一人的威霸——白木馬一號！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:29.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,二號頻道，可搭載四人的購物船——迷你梅利二號！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:35.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,三號頻道，可搭載三人的偵查潛水艇——鯊魚潛水三號！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:39.31,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,目前，這就是船塢系統的全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:44.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,把它們想成是輔助千陽號的士兵就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:48.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我真的很喜歡你的想法，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.45,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你！你！你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:54.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,沒錯，這禮拜我也是超級厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,超級！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.05,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:05.06,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.17,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.68,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這霧什麼都看不見。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:16.06,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,是從島的方向傳來的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:17.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,快讓我也坐迷你梅利！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.65,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,混蛋，你應該擔心娜美小姐的安全！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你也該擔心另外兩個人的安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:31.88,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,也許她是被幽靈詛咒然後尖叫了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.93,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,別說了，一點都不好笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.94,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒人碰錨啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:47.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,船這麼新，齒輪不應該磨損得這麼快…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:50.55,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,快拉上來，船要翻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:54.94,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:56.39,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有人動了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒有。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.44,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒有人靠近過。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:08.62,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.62,0:08:10.08,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.85,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,在這種時候別鬧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.44,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不，不系的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.44,Note,Luffy,0,0,100,,{\an8}不，不是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:15.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,窩什麼都莫幹！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:15.66,Note,Luffy,0,0,100,,{\an8}我什麼都沒幹！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.13,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,小心，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.21,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你到底幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.16,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,抱歉，我的刀自己動了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.68,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這很奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:40.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,除了我們以外…在這甲板上…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.44,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,還有其他東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,也許是幽靈幹的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,或者是惡魔果實能力者什麼的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:00.29,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對，感覺有人抓住了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:04.66,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我聽到了野獸的咆哮。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:05.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,野獸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.12,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,總之，我很擔心娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:09.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們看好船！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:13.50,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我去救他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.41,Main,all,0,0,0,,好遜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,哇，香吉士在漂浮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:33.83,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你發出了「嗬嘎」的聲音。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:34.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.02,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,換成你也一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們連船都離不了了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.44,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他們到底想幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:43.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,如果想殺我們，早就可以動手了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:45.26,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,怎麼了，羅賓小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:48.81,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,有什麼…抓住了我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.87,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你竟敢做這種事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:54.49,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的有動物！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:03.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,現在怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:04.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,浪！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.79,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,在這柵欄裡面，一定是人造的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.35,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,船要翻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:11.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓小姐，走了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.68,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我沒事，我想它離開了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:17.46,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，嗬嘎，拉起錨，不然我們要沉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:18.80,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,誰是「嗬嘎」啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.18,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,騙人布！喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.73,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們聽得到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡，要跟娜美小姐分開了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.66,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:28.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,用秘密武器想想辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:32.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好，我有「飛行驚喜水池」可以用！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,聽起來很好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.28,Main,all,0,0,0,,你這白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好…好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:46.32,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,當然會痛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:50.98,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們一定是掉到這裡來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:56.42,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在幽靈島上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.77,Main,both,0,0,0,,幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.94,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,哎，別這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:02.74,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不用害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:07.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但我們到底怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:11.10,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在迷你梅利上玩得太開心，不小心撞上了岸。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:15.22,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,霧太大看不清…分心了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:18.07,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們三個都被甩了出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.38,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,轉眼之間，就到了這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:25.48,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,百分之百是我的錯，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:27.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,因為我很可愛，所以就原諒我嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.20,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看我怎麼收拾你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:42.80,Captions,text,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(541.49,100)}{}非常抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:35.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過說來也奇怪，才剛到這座島就有一條大溝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:38.20,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,大概是用來抓敵人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:42.23,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,幸好裡面沒有尖刺。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:42.78,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是啊，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:46.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,多虧落在這些骷髏上面我們才沒事。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.46,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,叫你別說了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:53.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但這裡應該是入口。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:56.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,只要在這裡等，魯夫會找到我們的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:12:00.82,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但我們在海平面以下，感覺有點恐怖。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:04.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是啊，很危險，而且他們可能看不到我們在這。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:07.99,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那要不要在上面的岸邊等？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,岸邊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:13.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但我不知道哪個方向…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:22.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,狗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:29.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那不是狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:32.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那…那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.26,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那個…不可能是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:36.55,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,地…地…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:39.09,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,地獄犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:42.35,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是地獄犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,地…地獄犬是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:48.22,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是地獄的看門狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:49.76,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,真的存在嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,肯定的，就在我們後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:56.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那這裡就是地獄嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.02,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們在地獄裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:03.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快跑就對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:06.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,被抓到就會被吃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:15.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，怎麼了，喬巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:17.23,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喬巴，你看到什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,「空」…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.50,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂，你仔細看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.55,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,其中一個頭不是狐狸嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在又叫「嗯」了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.86,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,它很不高興！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對不起！對不起！對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.53,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,看，階梯！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:42.45,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,從那邊可以出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:46.10,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,謝天謝地！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,明明是狗，鼻子卻這麼不靈？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:15.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:16.88,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,現在怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:19.45,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們跑進了一片森林…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:24.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果那東西在附近遊蕩，不找地方躲起來很危險…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.23,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,您說得沒錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:33.17,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,我叫希爾頓。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:36.85,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,我看到你們被看門狗追趕，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:39.06,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,所以暗中跟著，以防你們有麻煩。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:44.25,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,畢竟天很快就要黑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:49.97,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,對不熟悉這片森林的人來說，這裡會變得極度危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:15:03.45,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,如果你們願意，我可以帶你們去我們的宅邸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:04.56,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,宅邸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.92,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:09.62,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,霍古巴克大人的宅邸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼回事，喬巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:15.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,霍古巴克？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.06,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:27.67,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,霧太大看不太清那些馬，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:30.01,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,它們有什麼問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:32.66,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,哦，只是你的錯覺。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:39.02,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那…那就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，你救了我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,謝謝，我們剛才遇到麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:44.49,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡，這是我的榮幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:46.22,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,要來杯飲料嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:54.83,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,這片森林到處都是奇怪的動物，步行穿越很危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:56.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是啊，我剛才嚇了一跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.57,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我以為地獄犬只是虛構的生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:02.73,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看起來像變異體什麼的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:08.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我當時還在想能不能從那棵樹上下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:12.32,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,如果你們在等人，宅邸是最理想的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.43,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,它非常顯眼，而且非常安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:18.19,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,而且我們還能見到霍古巴克醫生。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:20.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他真的那麼有名嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:23.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,所有醫生都聽過他的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:25.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他是外科天才！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:30.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他用奇蹟般的手術救活了無數的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:35.35,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他擁有一個醫生所能獲得的一切地位和榮譽，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:39.23,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,受到各地醫生的尊敬！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但有一天，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.55,0:16:43.21,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他突然失蹤了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:46.45,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,有傳言說他被綁架了，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:49.45,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,全世界的醫生都為此騷動。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:56.11,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但多年來杳無音訊，\N霍古巴克的名字如今只是一個傳說…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.56,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那個霍古巴克醫生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:05.70,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,是的，即使現在醫生仍然在研究新事物。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.87,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我想要簽名！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.87,0:17:12.21,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,應該可以安排的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:14.71,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不會吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:19.22,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這片森林裡竟然還有獅子？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你幹嘛啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:33.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別嚇我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:38.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,剛…剛才，有一隻獅…獅子…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:41.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,就像這樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,騙人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.32,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那你自己看啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.10,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,看到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:53.55,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,{\i1}食物，食物，食物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.59,Main,all,0,0,0,,有東西在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:16.21,Main,all,0,0,0,,絕對有東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.25,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.01,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,請停下馬車，希爾頓先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:23.69,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,你為什麼這麼激動？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:25.13,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,也許只是看錯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不，她沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.35,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,外面有東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這片森林太奇怪了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:32.89,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,是的，這是一片奇怪的森林。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:35.94,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,而且，由於濃霧加上人們的恐懼心理，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.43,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,很多人以為自己在這裡看到了東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:40.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,所以，不是真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:44.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不，等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幻覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.05,0:18:47.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不，剛才太清楚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.55,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,希爾頓先生，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:53.89,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,很抱歉，你可以帶我們去海岸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:56.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我知道很危險，但我們應付得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:02.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但那樣就不能見到霍古巴克醫生了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我想見他！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不不，我了解你的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:10.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但這次我們得相信我們的特殊能力——「這裡有鬼」感應器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.43,0:19:12.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你是想冒死去見那個醫生…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.38,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,還是活著離開這座島但見不到他…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你選哪個？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.37,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,嗯，我不想死。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:18.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我太害怕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.46,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,哦，是這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:23.82,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,如果你們這麼決定的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:26.71,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,各位，請在這裡等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.48,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,停車！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:34.52,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,抱歉讓你失去機會了，喬巴…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:41.02,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,沒關係，我就是沒辦法像魯夫那樣一個人說走就走…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:45.30,Captions,text,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,0)}十分鐘後…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.30,Main,text,0,0,400,,{\fad(800,800)}{\c&HFDB873&\fs70}寂靜…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:48.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,奇怪，他只是轉個彎而已…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那裡沒有人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:57.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,馬也不見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:20:01.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們被丟在墓地中間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.83,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:03.53,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼會？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:06.12,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他拋棄我們了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,也…也許他只是去上廁所！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,希爾頓！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:12.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，你去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:40.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但為什麼偏偏是墓地？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:42.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:03.94,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不…不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.54,Main,all,0,0,0,,殭…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:17.56,Main,all,0,0,0,,殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好痛好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.19,0:21:26.30,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:30.17,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他們要掀翻馬車了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:32.00,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這些傢伙力氣真大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:46.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他咬我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,該死，他咬我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我會變成殭屍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:50.22,Secondary,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:52.83,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我來救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不，別過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:03.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.37,0:22:05.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:12.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,放開騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:16.26,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:25.26,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.73,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,喂，你掉了這個。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:28.68,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,謝謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:33.31,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:34.03,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他們要咬我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:35.60,Main,both,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:36.80,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,放開…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:38.20,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,退後！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:39.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,殭屍的弱點是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.85,0:22:40.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:41.83,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火焰星！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:45.69,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,火！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:47.24,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,小心，你會被燒到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:50.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,效果比我想像中好太多了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.25,0:22:51.94,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,你竟敢這樣對我們，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:53.98,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,如果打到我們怎麼辦，白痴？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:55.22,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,你這壞蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.22,0:22:57.56,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但現在殭屍真的生氣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:58.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,走吧，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.65,0:23:00.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在就逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:06.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,既然已經跑這麼遠了，直接跑去宅邸最近！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:08.44,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好，就這麼做！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:10.47,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好恐怖…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:15.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,只要離開墓地，拚命跑就沒事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:19.94,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,殭屍只會呻吟和慢慢走路！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.28,0:23:21.60,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,慢慢地，慢慢地！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:22.74,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,等一下，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:23.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們跑得很快！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.96,0:23:36.46,Main,zombie,0,0,0,,我累了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:41.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們沒有體力！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:50.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好像…甩掉他們了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:52.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這座島到底怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:55.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,到處都是不應該活著的東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:55.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:59.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果我變成殭屍的話，你們就{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:01.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.56,0:24:05.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我在千陽號圖書室找到的殭屍書上看的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.19,0:24:09.33,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,明明這麼怕這些東西，倒是看了不少相關書籍。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.48,0:24:13.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好了，到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.49,0:24:15.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我只想喝杯水。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:18.36,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我終於可以見到他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:19.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:21.53,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我敢打賭在這種島上…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.53,0:24:25.74,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,找不到一個正經人住在這。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.52,0:24:28.42,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,打擾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:31.90,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這裡是霍古巴克醫生的宅邸嗎？
Comment: 0,0:00:57.22,0:01:01.52,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,550)}Title card artist\N{\fs40}someone
